      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this feature would be great but not on all items, things that you place on the floor should be kept the same size for everyone. but hand held items should get the scaling, items like the snow spewer thingy already effect a huge area and I feel like it would be annoying to deal with.\n\nI understand anyone could just turn these items off but I still think it would just be more annoying then usefull.",
